{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國一名聯邦法官上周六（10月31日）駁回總統特朗普對《華爾街日報》、該報母公司新聞集團及名譽主席梅鐸的誹謗訴訟。</p><p>該報2025年7月報道稱特朗普曾於2003年致函「富豪淫媒」愛潑斯坦（Jeffrey Epstein），信中疑有裸體女子素描。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:49.429245+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T08:41:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T04:18:46.251709+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:26.770792+00:00","content_hash":"868063a7cd768a05717a76d27bc085a73a5857ac53913b974471abc755dbaae5","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}